session row: {err}\"))\n757: +    }\n758: +\n759: +    fn pending_seq_bounds(&self, session_id: &str) -> Result<Option<(i64, i64)>, String> {\n760: +        pending_seq_bounds_on(&self.conn, session_id)\n761: +    }\n762: +\n763:      #[cfg(test)]\n764:      fn enqueue_agent_bash_complete_then_rollback(\n765:          &mut self,\n766: @@ -644,6 +817,20 @@ impl MailboxDb {\n767:      }\n768:  }\n769:  \n770: +fn wake_sweep_candidate(\n771: +    session_id: String,\n772: +    auto_wake_count: i64,\n773: +    min_pending_seq: i64,\n774: +    max_pending_seq: i64,\n775: +) -> WakeSweepCandidate {\n776: +    WakeSweepCandidate {\n777: +        session_id,\n778: +        auto_wake_count,\n779: +        min_pending_seq,\n780: +        max_pending_seq,\n781: +    }\n782: +}\n783: +\n784:  fn enqueue_agent_bash_complete_in_tx(\n785:      tx: &rusqlite::Transaction<'_>,\n786:      input: &AgentBashCompleteEnqueue<'_>,\n787: @@ -896,13 +1083,76 @@ fn session_liveness_from_decision(decision: &SessionRuntimeLivenessDecision) ->\n788:  }\n789:  \n790:  fn fresh_in_flight_wake_claim(\n791: +    tx: &rusqlite::Transaction<'_>,\n792:      existing: Option<WakeClaimRow>,\n793:      stale_after_seconds: i64,\n794:      renew_token: Option<&str>,\n795: -) -> Option<WakeClaimRow> {\n796: -    let existing = existing?;\n797: +) -> Result<Option<WakeClaimRow>, String> {\n798: +    let Some(existing) = existing else {\n799: +        return Ok(None);\n800: +    };\n801:      let renews_existing = renew_token == Some(existing.claim_token.as_str());\n802: -    (!claim_is_stale(&existing, stale_after_seconds) && !renews_existing).then_some(existing)\n803: +    if renews_existing || wake_claim_is_reclaimable(tx, &existing, stale_after_seconds)? {\n804: +        return Ok(None);\n805: +    }\n806: +    Ok(Some(existing))\n807: +}\n808: +\n809: +fn wake_claim_is_reclaimable(\n810: +    conn: &Connection,\n811: +    claim: &WakeClaimRow,\n812: +    stale_after_seconds: i64,\n813: +) -> Result<bool